text:
I don't know. I just seem to have a talent for it. I'm really enjoying AI video generation these days. Now I'm going to explore the limits of this model. 
Created with Google Omni 1.1 Flash. Music was added using Capcut. Feel free to test it and post your results here in the comments.
Be warned: the prompt is provocative.🥵
You can see the result below👇
